-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§§ `Order 34 as regulative rules: traces`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- A trace prints FULFILLED, a breach, or what is still owed.  A DEONTIC cannot be compared in an #ASSERT on main,
-- so each trace carries the expected outcome on the line above and work/trace-check.py (run by hand, on both
-- builds) compares.  Day 0 is the day the period starts; the Rules count the days (O 3 r 3), these traces only
-- count a plain number of days.

-- o 34 r 4(1) the duty to make and serve the application: the act on day 14 (the last day) satisfies the duty.
-- expect: FULFILLED
#TRACE `o 34 r 4(1) the duty to make and serve the application` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `o 34 r 4(1) the applicant for a ruling on a question of law` DOES `o 34 r 4(1) make the application and serve it` AT 14

-- the act on day 15 is late.
-- expect: BREACH
#TRACE `o 34 r 4(1) the duty to make and serve the application` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `o 34 r 4(1) the applicant for a ruling on a question of law` DOES `o 34 r 4(1) make the application and serve it` AT 15

-- no act at all by day 15.
-- expect: BREACH
#TRACE `o 34 r 4(1) the duty to make and serve the application` AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 15

-- o 34 r 5(3) the duty to file the affidavit opposing the application: the act on day 14 (the last day) satisfies the duty.
-- expect: FULFILLED
#TRACE `o 34 r 5(3) the duty to file the affidavit opposing the application` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `o 34 r 5(3) the defendant` DOES `o 34 r 5(3) file the affidavit opposing the application` AT 14

-- the act on day 15 is late.
-- expect: BREACH
#TRACE `o 34 r 5(3) the duty to file the affidavit opposing the application` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `o 34 r 5(3) the defendant` DOES `o 34 r 5(3) file the affidavit opposing the application` AT 15

-- no act at all by day 15.
-- expect: BREACH
#TRACE `o 34 r 5(3) the duty to file the affidavit opposing the application` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 15

-- o 34 r 6(3) the duty to serve the appellant's Case and the core bundle: the act on day 28 (the last day) satisfies the duty.
-- expect: FULFILLED
#TRACE `o 34 r 6(3) the duty to serve the appellant's Case and the core bundle` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `o 34 r 6(3) the appellant` DOES `o 34 r 6(3) serve the appellant's Case and the core bundle` AT 28

-- the act on day 29 is late.
